<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - BP raised to &quot;buy&quot; at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BP raised to &quot;buy&quot; at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum Co Plc was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; at BZW on Monday, market sources.</p>
<p>The brokerage advised investors to switch out of rival Shell Transport &amp; Trading Co Plc and into BP, sources said.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment. BP shares were up 2-1/2p at 748-1/2 by 0913 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
